WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.650
One verse of the Qur'an says the heavens
and the earth were of one piece, then

2
00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:05.740
parted.

3
00:00:05.790 --> 00:00:08.600
Another says that the
heaven was once smoke.

4
00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:11.700
Some Muslims hear the
Big Bang in these words.

5
00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:16.280
Then came evolution, and a new set
of questions about how life began.

6
00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:21.780
So does the Qur'an predict the Big Bang,
and must a Muslim reject evolution?

7
00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:25.840
In this mission, you'll test three pictures
of the universe against teaching on

8
00:00:25.890 --> 00:00:26.890
creation.

9
00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:30.810
Then you'll map the range of
Muslim views on science today.

10
00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:34.630
Your mission: find out whether
the Qur'an predicts the Big Bang,

11
00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:37.720
and whether a Muslim
must reject evolution.
